WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Gantt view. Bars from start to due date with dependency arrows; drag to reschedule.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: launch plan.

3
00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.640
Gantt draws each task from its start to its due date.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.580
Arrows show what's blocking what.

5
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.050
Drag a bar's end to change that date…

6
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:21.170
…or drag the whole bar to move both dates.

7
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:27.170
A task has no bar: Give it a due date (and optionally a start date).

8
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.670
Start-to-due bars
